---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About AM Digital" description="AM Digital is an AI-powered GTM operations agency founded in Hanoi in 2015, running global and local campaigns across ecommerce, technology and app products.">
  <article class="about-page">
    <header class="about-hero section" aria-labelledby="about-title">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy" data-reveal>
          <p class="eyebrow">About AM Digital</p>
          <h1 id="about-title">AI-powered GTM operations. Global reach. Specialist execution.</h1>
          <p class="lede">Founded in Hanoi in 2015, AM Digital runs global and local campaigns for DTC ecommerce brands, technology companies and app products.</p>
          <a class="button button--green" href="#differentiators">What sets us apart <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-media" data-reveal>
          <img src="/images/am-global-team.webp" width="1536" height="1024" alt="AM Digital specialists working together around a laptop" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
          <p aria-label="Core capabilities"><span>Strategy</span><span>Execution</span><span>Automation</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="fit-section section" aria-labelledby="fit-title">
      <div class="container split-row">
        <div class="section-copy" data-reveal>
          <p class="eyebrow">Who we are</p>
          <h2 id="fit-title">Built for global and local markets.</h2>
          <p>Over a decade, we have run campaigns across Vietnam, Southeast Asia, the US, Europe, India and LATAM—covering DTC ecommerce brands and technology and app products.</p>
          <p>We operate across the full spectrum from strategy to execution, with AI automation wired into every workflow so campaigns move faster, reporting is continuous, and the operation runs efficiently at every scale.</p>
          <a class="text-link story-link" href="#story">Explore our beginnings <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        </div>
        <img src="/images/am-market-entry.webp" width="1400" height="1050" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="AM Digital team discussing a campaign plan" />
      </div>
      <details id="story" class="container story-panel">
        <summary>
          <span class="story-summary-title"><small>Our beginnings</small><strong>The Story of AM Digital</strong></span>
          <span class="story-summary-meta"><em>Vietnam · Founded 2015</em><b>Read the story <i aria-hidden="true">+</i></b></span>
        </summary>
        <div class="story-content">
          <div class="story-intro">
            <div class="story-heading">
              <p class="eyebrow">The belief that started it</p>
              <p class="story-lede">AM Digital began in Vietnam as a small group of freelancers working on Upwork. We had no big office or well-known name. What we had was a belief that still guides us today: <strong>effort can take us further than ability alone.</strong></p>
            </div>
            <div class="story-copy">
              <p>At first, every project was a chance to learn and earn trust. We asked questions, listened closely, and worked to understand what each client was trying to achieve. When we encountered something we did not know, we learned it. When an idea could be stronger, we improved it.</p>
              <p>That way of working became our culture.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="story-ending">
            <p>One project led to another. Our small team grew into a business, and AM Digital went on to work with brands such as Perplexity, Speak AI, Gleam, Prep, and italki. We are proud that a team from Vietnam has earned the opportunity to work alongside brands with ambitions that reach across borders.</p>
            <p>We have grown since our first days on Upwork, but the principle behind our work remains the same: understand the people we serve, do what we promise, and put in the effort to make the work better every time.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="core-values" aria-labelledby="values-title">
            <div class="values-heading"><p class="eyebrow">How we work</p><h4 id="values-title">Four values.<br />One standard.</h4></div>
            <article><span>01</span><h5>Effort</h5><p>Giving every project the attention it deserves.</p></article>
            <article><span>02</span><h5>Trust</h5><p>Keeping our promises and taking responsibility for our work.</p></article>
            <article><span>03</span><h5>Understanding</h5><p>Listening before proposing a solution.</p></article>
            <article><span>04</span><h5>Creativity</h5><p>Finding a better way forward when the familiar approach is not enough.</p></article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>
    </section>

    <section class="metrics-section" aria-label="AM Digital company facts">
      <div class="container metrics-grid">
        <div><strong>10+</strong><span>Years running<br />global campaigns</span></div>
        <div><strong>100+</strong><span>Clients across<br />multiple niches</span></div>
        <div><strong>5 ★</strong><span>Average<br />client rating</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="differentiators" class="process-section section" aria-labelledby="process-title">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">Why AM Digital</p>
        <h2 id="process-title">Three core differentiators</h2>
        <ol class="process-list">
          <li><span>1</span><div><h3>Global campaign reach</h3><p>We run campaigns simultaneously across multiple markets—the US, Vietnam, India, LATAM and Europe—so your brand is not constrained to a single-country test before scaling.</p></div></li>
          <li><span>2</span><div><h3>Specialist operational depth</h3><p>We bring dedicated expertise across paid ads, influencer and UGC, SEO/AEO/GEO and GTM strategy—operating together as one connected motion rather than isolated services.</p></div></li>
          <li><span>3</span><div><h3>AI automation at every layer</h3><p>AI and automation are wired into creator sourcing, campaign reporting, content scheduling and outreach sequencing, helping the operation move faster and cover more ground.</p></div></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="origin-section section" aria-labelledby="origin-title">
      <div class="container origin-grid">
        <div class="origin-copy" data-reveal>
          <p class="eyebrow">Who we work with</p>
          <h2 id="origin-title">Different businesses. The right growth motion for each.</h2>
          <strong>Three core groups.</strong>
          <p>Our operating model adapts to the market, stage and infrastructure each client already has.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="audience-list" data-reveal>
          <article><span>01</span><h3>DTC and ecommerce brands</h3><p>Foreign ecommerce and DTC brands scaling revenue, expanding into new markets, or needing a connected operation across paid ads, influencer content and conversion—particularly in Southeast Asia and Vietnam.</p><small>Skincare & beauty · Fashion & apparel · Health & supplement · Food & beverage · Home & lifestyle</small></article>
          <article><span>02</span><h3>Tech startups and app products</h3><p>Early-stage and growth-stage technology companies testing GTM ideas, acquiring users across global markets, or building marketing infrastructure that a lean team cannot operate alone.</p><small>Consumer apps · SaaS · Edtech · Fintech · Gaming · Health tech</small></article>
          <article><span>03</span><h3>Global brands entering Vietnam</h3><p>Foreign brands across ecommerce, technology and B2B entering Vietnam for the first time, needing local knowledge, genuine localization and a team that has operated here since 2015.</p><small>Ecommerce · App and technology products · B2B market entry</small></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-cta" aria-labelledby="about-cta-title">
      <div class="container">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Let’s talk</p><h2 id="about-cta-title">Want to know how we would approach your growth?</h2></div>
        <a class="button button--green" href="/contact/">Let’s talk <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  const storyLink = document.querySelector<HTMLAnchorElement>('.story-link');
  const story = document.querySelector<HTMLDetailsElement>('#story');
  const openStoryFromHash = () => {
    if (window.location.hash === '#story' && story) story.open = true;
  };
  storyLink?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (story) story.open = true;
  });
  openStoryFromHash();
  window.addEventListener('hashchange', openStoryFromHash);
</script>

<style>
  .about-page { background:var(--white); }
  .about-hero { padding-block:clamp(2.25rem,4vw,3.5rem); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
  .hero-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.15fr) minmax(24rem,.85fr); gap:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,5rem); align-items:center; }
  .hero-copy h1 { max-width:17ch; margin:.9rem 0 1.5rem; font-size:clamp(3rem,4.5vw,4.75rem); }
  .lede { max-width:38rem; margin-bottom:2rem; color:var(--muted); font-size:clamp(1.05rem,1.45vw,1.3rem); }
  .hero-media { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 8rem; gap:1.5rem; align-items:stretch; }
  .hero-media img { width:100%; height:100%; min-height:18rem; object-fit:cover; }
  .hero-media p { margin:0; padding:4.5rem 0 0 1.25rem; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:.45rem; border-left:1px solid var(--line); color:var(--navy-soft); font-size:.78rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.09em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .hero-media p::after { content:""; width:2rem; margin-top:.7rem; border-top:2px solid var(--green); }
  .fit-section { padding-block:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.5rem); }
  .split-row { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(20rem,.85fr) minmax(0,1.25fr); gap:clamp(3rem,8vw,8rem); align-items:center; }
  .split-row > img { width:min(100%,38rem); height:clamp(20rem,28vw,25rem); justify-self:end; object-fit:cover; object-position:center 42%; }
  .section-copy h2 { max-width:12ch; margin:.8rem 0 1.5rem; font-size:clamp(2.65rem,4.3vw,4.4rem); }
  .section-copy > p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width:34rem; margin-top:1rem; color:var(--muted); }
  .text-link { display:inline-flex; gap:1rem; margin-top:2rem; color:var(--green); font-weight:800; text-decoration:none; }
  .story-panel { margin-top:clamp(3rem,6vw,5rem); overflow:hidden; background:var(--navy); color:var(--white); }
  .story-panel summary { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:2rem; padding:clamp(1.4rem,3vw,2.15rem) clamp(1.4rem,4vw,3.25rem); cursor:pointer; list-style:none; }
  .story-panel summary::-webkit-details-marker { display:none; }
  .story-summary-title { display:grid; gap:.35rem; }
  .story-panel summary small { color:var(--green-bright); font-size:.7rem; font-weight:850; letter-spacing:.16em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .story-panel summary strong { font-size:clamp(1.5rem,2.8vw,2.45rem); letter-spacing:-.045em; line-height:1; }
  .story-summary-meta { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:clamp(1.25rem,3vw,3rem); }
  .story-summary-meta em { color:rgba(255,255,255,.58); font-size:.7rem; font-style:normal; font-weight:750; letter-spacing:.11em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .story-summary-meta b { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.85rem; color:var(--green-bright); font-size:.75rem; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; white-space:nowrap; }
  .story-panel summary i { width:2.5rem; height:2.5rem; display:grid; place-items:center; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28); border-radius:50%; font-size:1.45rem; font-style:normal; font-weight:400; transition:transform .2s ease,background-color .2s ease; }
  .story-panel summary:hover i { background:rgba(255,255,255,.08); }
  .story-panel[open] summary i { transform:rotate(45deg); }
  .story-content { padding:clamp(2.75rem,6vw,5.5rem) clamp(1.4rem,4vw,3.25rem); border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15); background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f2fbf5 0%,#fff 42%,#f4f8f5 100%); color:var(--ink); }
  .story-intro { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(16rem,.82fr) minmax(0,1.18fr); gap:clamp(2.25rem,6vw,6rem); }
  .story-heading { align-self:start; }
  .story-heading .eyebrow { margin-bottom:1.15rem; }
  .story-lede { max-width:34rem; padding-left:1.4rem; border-left:3px solid var(--green); color:var(--muted); font-size:clamp(1.08rem,1.65vw,1.35rem); line-height:1.6; }
  .story-lede strong { color:var(--green-dark); }
  .story-copy { max-width:44rem; font-size:clamp(1rem,1.25vw,1.12rem); }
  .story-copy p { margin-top:1.25rem; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.7; }
  .story-copy p:first-child { margin-top:0; }
  .story-copy strong { color:var(--ink); }
  .core-values { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:1px; margin-top:clamp(2.75rem,5vw,4.5rem); background:rgba(0,126,40,.22); border:1px solid rgba(0,126,40,.22); }
  .values-heading { grid-column:1 / -1; display:flex; align-items:end; justify-content:space-between; gap:2rem; padding:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.5rem); background:var(--white); }
  .values-heading h4 { color:var(--ink); font-size:clamp(2.25rem,4vw,4.2rem); line-height:.9; letter-spacing:-.065em; text-align:right; }
  .core-values article { position:relative; min-height:15rem; padding:clamp(1.35rem,2.5vw,2rem); overflow:hidden; background:var(--white); }
  .core-values article:nth-of-type(even) { background:#e8f7ed; }
  .core-values article span { display:block; margin-bottom:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.25rem); color:rgba(0,126,40,.28); font-size:clamp(2.4rem,4.4vw,4.3rem); font-weight:900; line-height:.8; letter-spacing:-.07em; }
  .core-values h5 { color:var(--green-dark); font-size:clamp(1.4rem,2.25vw,2rem); line-height:1; letter-spacing:-.045em; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
  .core-values article p { max-width:18rem; margin-top:.8rem; color:var(--muted); font-size:.9rem; line-height:1.5; }
  .story-ending { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:clamp(2rem,6vw,6rem); margin-top:clamp(2.75rem,5vw,4.5rem); padding-top:clamp(2.25rem,4vw,3.5rem); border-top:1px solid rgba(0,126,40,.25); }
  .story-ending p { color:var(--muted); line-height:1.7; }
  .story-ending p:last-child { color:var(--ink); font-weight:700; }
  .metrics-section { background:var(--navy); color:var(--white); }
  .metrics-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); }
  .metrics-grid > div { display:grid; min-height:11rem; place-content:center; padding:2rem; border-inline-start:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2); text-align:center; }
  .metrics-grid > div:last-child { border-inline-end:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2); }
  .metrics-grid strong { color:var(--green-bright); font-size:clamp(2.6rem,5vw,4.5rem); line-height:1; letter-spacing:-.06em; }
  .metrics-grid span { margin-top:.6rem; font-size:.78rem; font-weight:800; line-height:1.35; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .process-section { padding-block:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.25rem); border-block:1px solid var(--line); }
  .process-section h2 { margin:.7rem 0 2.5rem; font-size:clamp(2.5rem,4vw,4rem); }
  .process-list { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); margin:0; padding:0; list-style:none; }
  .process-list li { display:grid; grid-template-columns:4.5rem 1fr; gap:1.25rem; padding:0 2.5rem; border-left:1px solid var(--line); }
  .process-list li:first-child { padding-left:0; border-left:0; }
  .process-list span { width:4.1rem; height:4.1rem; display:grid; place-items:center; border:2px solid var(--green); border-radius:50%; color:var(--green); font-size:2rem; font-weight:850; }
  .process-list h3 { margin:.45rem 0 .35rem; font-size:1.25rem; letter-spacing:-.035em; }
  .process-list p { color:var(--muted); font-size:.95rem; line-height:1.4; }
  .origin-section { padding-block:clamp(3rem,7vw,6.5rem); }
  .origin-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(20rem,.9fr) minmax(0,1.1fr); gap:clamp(3rem,8vw,7rem); }
  .origin-copy h2 { max-width:12ch; margin:.8rem 0 2rem; font-size:clamp(2.7rem,4.3vw,4.6rem); }
  .origin-copy strong { display:block; margin-bottom:1.6rem; color:var(--green-bright); font-size:clamp(2.4rem,4.2vw,4rem); letter-spacing:-.06em; line-height:.95; }
  .origin-copy > p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width:35rem; margin-top:1.25rem; color:var(--muted); }
  .audience-list { border-top:1px solid var(--line); }
  .audience-list article { position:relative; display:grid; grid-template-columns:4rem 1fr; column-gap:1.5rem; padding:2rem 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
  .audience-list article > span { grid-row:1 / 4; color:var(--green); font-size:1.4rem; font-weight:850; }
  .audience-list h3 { font-size:clamp(1.5rem,2.4vw,2.2rem); line-height:1; }
  .audience-list p { margin-top:.75rem; color:var(--muted); font-size:1rem; line-height:1.55; }
  .audience-list small { margin-top:.9rem; color:var(--green-dark); font-size:.75rem; font-weight:750; line-height:1.5; }
  .origin-media img { width:100%; aspect-ratio:1.65; object-fit:cover; object-position:center 42%; }
  .origin-media dl { margin:1.35rem 0 0; }
  .origin-media dl div { padding:1.1rem 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
  .origin-media dt { margin-bottom:.45rem; color:var(--navy-soft); font-size:.75rem; font-weight:850; letter-spacing:.1em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .origin-media dd { margin:0; color:var(--muted); font-size:1rem; }
  .about-cta { padding:2.75rem 0; border-block:1px solid var(--line); }
  .about-cta .container { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:3rem; }
  .about-cta h2 { max-width:21ch; margin-top:.8rem; font-size:clamp(2.2rem,3.6vw,3.6rem); }
  @media (max-width:800px) {
    .hero-grid,.split-row,.origin-grid,.story-intro { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .story-summary-meta em,.story-summary-meta b { font-size:0; }
    .story-panel summary i { font-size:1.45rem; }
    .core-values { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); }
    .values-heading { align-items:flex-start; flex-direction:column; }
    .values-heading h4 { text-align:left; }
    .story-ending { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .hero-media { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .hero-media p { padding:1rem 0 0; flex-direction:row; flex-wrap:wrap; border:0; }
    .hero-media p::after { display:none; }
    .split-row > img { grid-row:1; width:100%; height:18rem; justify-self:stretch; }
    .process-list { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:1.5rem; }
    .process-list li,.process-list li:first-child { padding:0 0 1.5rem; border-left:0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
    .metrics-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .metrics-grid > div,.metrics-grid > div:last-child { min-height:8rem; border-inline:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2); }
    .about-cta .container { align-items:flex-start; flex-direction:column; }
  }
  @media (max-width:520px) {
    .story-panel summary { gap:1rem; }
    .story-panel summary strong { font-size:1.35rem; }
    .core-values { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .core-values article { min-height:12rem; }
    .core-values article span { margin-bottom:2rem; }
  }
</style>
